Source tapes/settings.tape
Hide
Sleep 500ms
Type@1ms "exec ./demo-term.sh"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type@1ms "cp ~/original/stats.py stats.py; clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Type "# F · Rust extension / reload / upstream Doom overlay"
Enter
Type "pig -e ~/chain-rs"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "/chain fix the failing tests"
Enter
Sleep 10s
Type "!cp -R ~/doom-overlay .pig/extensions/doom-overlay"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "/reload"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "/doom-overlay ./.pig/extensions/doom-overlay/doom1.wad"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "w"
Sleep 2s
Type "f"
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+D
Sleep 1s
